    "text": "A nucleus of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>m</mi></math> is at rest and decays into two daughter nuclei of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> each. If the speed of light is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, then the speed of any one of the daughter nuclei is"
